 "remarks": "The perfect blend of timeless charm and modern comfort, this beautifully renovated storybook Cape is nestled along a quiet Springdale street on a private, fully fenced quarter acre with exceptional curb appeal. Offering 4 bedrooms, 2 baths and 1,622 sq ft, this inviting home boasts a sun drenched, versatile floor plan. A gracious dining room with wood burning fireplace and oversized picture window flows into the spacious living room with sliders overlooking the picturesque backyard. The updated kitchen features granite counters, subway tile backsplash, st/st appliances & direct outdoor access, ideal for entertaining. 2 main level bedrooms offer flexibility for a home office, complemented by custom laundry & pantry storage nook, as well as a tastefully renovated full bath w/hexagon floor tile and shower/tub combo. Upstairs, 2 generously sized bedrooms share a beautifully updated bath with dual vanity. The lower level provides ample storage & garage access. Outside, enjoy a newly installed patio, lush level lawn framed by mature trees and privacy hedges with a full privacy fence, & a charming front porch perfect for morning coffee. Notable features include central air, two upstairs mini splits, refinished hardwood floors, newer roof, windows and slider, and upgraded 200 amp electrical service. Just a short stroll to Springdale Train Station and village shops and dining, with convenient access to the Merritt Parkway and I95. An exceptional place to call home!",
